            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.18

- Live limits: every Claude Code reply now updates the account's 5-hour and weekly numbers in Side A, with no extra requests. Your own statusline keeps working exactly as before.
- No more rate limits on readings: while sessions report live, Side A checks the usage service only every 15 minutes, for Fable, paid usage and use on other devices.
- Turn it off in Settings > Autopilot; your statusline is restored as it was.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
